The investment objective of the Sub-Fund is long term capital appreciation, which the Sub-Fund seeks to achieve by investing mainly:
either directly or through financial derivatives, through long and short positions, in equity, and equity linked securities (such as warrants) issued by companies that are incorporated under the laws of, and have their registered office in China, Hong Kong and Taiwan or that carry out their main activity in one of these countries, even if listed elsewhere;
And , through indirect investments, in China A-Shares via derivatives instruments and Participatory-Notes within the limit of 35% of the total net assets of the Sub-Fund.

