- Carry intends to benefit from the tendency that instruments with higher yields outperform those with lower yields;
- Volatility intends to benefit from the tendency that volatility is trading at a higher level than the volatility that will be realized.
Measured over a period of five years, this sub-fund aims to beat the 1 month US LIBOR rate.

