The investment objective of the Sub-Fund is to outperform the daily-capitalized EONIA over its recommended minimum investment period of 5 years by more than:
 6.00% for the I share classes;
 6.00% for the M share classes;
 5.80% for the N share classes;
 5.20% for the R share classes;
 4.50% for the RE share classes,
with a target 1-year volatility based on weekly data comprised between 6% and 9%.

